# promise: #499
# A tab held at the sidebar's edge pages to the space on that side, as in Arc
# (TablistEdgeDragController): the right edge toward the next space, the left toward the previous,
# once every SidebarEdgeDrag.delay (0.5 s) it stays there, stopping at the first and last space.
# The drag is held without the pointer (cra://debug?edgeDrag); the timing and the edges are pinned
# in SidebarEdgeDragTests.
